zione a tre."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Murphy is an American living in Paris who enters a highly sexually and emotionally charged relationship with the unstable Electra. Unaware of the seismic effect it will have on their relationship, they invite their pretty neighbor into their bed."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Un 1er janvier au matin, le téléphone sonne. Murphy, 25 ans, se réveille entouré de sa jeune femme et de son enfant de deux ans. Il écoute son répondeur. Sur le message, la mère d'Electra lui demande, très inquiète, s'il n'a pas eu de nouvelle de sa fille disparue depuis longtemps. Elle craint qu'il lui soit arrivé un accident grave.  Au cours d'une longue journée pluvieuse, Murphy va se retrouver seul dans son appartement à se remémorer sa plus grande histoire d'amour, deux ans avec Electra. Une passion contenant toutes sortes de promesses, de jeux, d'excès et d'erreurs..."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uc7ASg5JhTmDQOuColvxmNaTi7P.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hoszursvZR1C054sTXVQBcBDory.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":292431,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yz6lmOmsmYuj6AOLG4LIwK5eJZF.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yz6lmOmsmYuj6AOLG4LIwK5eJZF.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yz6lmOmsmYuj6AOLG4LIwK5eJZF.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yz6lmOmsmYuj6AOLG4LIwK5eJZF.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jx5rG229bzPzBgCXGslje75Y85x.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jx5rG229bzPzBgCXGslje75Y85x.jpg","language":"en","